# === NODE: Set the category and note it ===
# Reads the AI's picks and keeps them only when every name is in the PSA's list under the level
# above it. With confirm true and confidence at or above minConfidence, it sets the open (blank)
# fields and writes an internal note with the reasoning. With confirm true and low confidence, it
# changes no field and writes an internal note with the suggestion. A preview (confirm false)
# writes nothing. Notes carry a marker, so a rerun never adds a second one.
